<h1>Kochański's workshop</h1>
<p>Adam Adamandy Kochański spent forty years on a single question: how to turn something elusive — the circumference of a circle, an oscillation, the movement of the Sun — into a number that can be repeated. The four instruments above can be operated.</p>
<p>Each of them works on its own and can be embedded on another site.</p>
